            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-mage1.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Built From the Ground Up",
            "text": "<p>At Grid Garage, we believe every great space starts with a solid foundation.</p><p>What began as a focus on premium interlocking flooring has evolved into something bigger—<strong>a complete garage transformation system</strong> designed to eliminate confusion, simplify decisions, and deliver professional-grade results without the hassle.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
