        "row_mhQrVp": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-mage2.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "The Problem We Solved",
            "text": "<p>Most garage upgrades are unnecessarily complicated.</p><p>Customers are forced to:</p><ul><li>Calculate square footage</li><li>Guess tile quantities</li><li>Figure out edge pieces</li><li>Piece together storage solutions from multiple places</li></ul><p>It’s overwhelming, it leads to hesitation, mistakes, or abandoned projects.</p><p>We built Grid Garage to fix that.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_tJpNba": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-mage3.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Our Solution: The Kit System",
            "text": "<p>We don’t sell parts. We sell complete solutions.</p><p>Every product on our site is built around our <strong>pre-configured kit model</strong>, designed for real-world spaces and real-world use.</p><ul><li>2-Car Garage Kits</li><li>3-Car Garage Kits</li><li>Home Gym Kits</li><li>Detailing Bay Kits</li><li>Patio & Outdoor Kits</li></ul><p>Each kit includes exactly what you need, tiles, edges, and finishing pieces pre-calculated and bundled into <strong>one simple price.</strong></p><p>No guesswork. No calculators. No surprises.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_wFaL93": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2020-05_Derek_Hartman_Slate_Grey_Pearl_Grey_-_RT_1.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Designed for Real Life",
            "text": "<p>This isn’t a complicated renovation.</p><p>Our interlocking system is built for <strong>simple, DIY installation</strong>—no special tools or contractors required.</p><p>Most projects can be completed in <strong>as little as 3 hours</strong>, making it a realistic upgrade you can knock out in a single afternoon.</p><p>Many of our customers install their floors with their families, turning what would normally be a stressful project into a <strong>fun, hands-on experience with a finished result you’re proud of.</strong></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_y3Diya": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/before-canada-garage3.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "More Than Flooring",
            "text": "<p>A finished floor is just the beginning.</p><p>To truly transform your space, you need a complete system—which is why we’ve expanded beyond flooring to include:</p><ul><li><strong>Garage Cabinets</strong> – Clean, durable storage that elevates your space</li><li><strong>Slatwall Systems</strong> – Flexible wall organization for tools, gear, and accessories</li></ul><p>Everything we offer is designed to work together, removing the cluter and optimizing functionally/visually, so your space doesn’t just look better, it works better.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_4zxeiU": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-mage6.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Built for Multiple Applications",
            "text": "<p>We’ve built this business around one core idea:<br/><br/><strong>One Click. One Price. No Surprises.</strong></p><ul><li>Free shipping on all tile floor kits</li><li>Clear, upfront pricing</li><li>Pre-built systems that eliminate confusion</li><li>Fast, reliable support when you need it<br/><br/></li></ul>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_jdAi7a": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-mage7.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Precision in Every Detail",
            "text": "<p>Our products are built with performance in mind:</p><ul><li>Heavy-duty interlocking tile systems</li><li>Engineered for durability, drainage, and longevity</li><li>Designed for both residential and high-traffic use</li></ul><p>Our interlocking system reflects what we stand for—<strong>precision, durability, and seamless design.</strong></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_WWTQ76": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-mage5.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Our Promise",
            "text": "<p>Our interlocking flooring is designed for versatility, durability, and clean aesthetics across a wide range of environments:</p><ul><li>Garages (2-car, 3-car, and custom layouts)</li><li>Home gyms and fitness spaces</li><li>Automotive detailing bays</li><li>Workshops and utility rooms</li><li>Patios and outdoor living areas</li><li>Pool decks and entertaining spaces</li><li>Basements and finished interiors</li><li>Man caves and hobby spaces</li></ul><p>One system. Endless possibilities.</p>",
